      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَبْدَبٌ</span></b>  The <i>walk of the long-legged ant.</i> (M,
K.) In the T it is said that ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَبْدَبَةٌ</span></b>  signifies The
<i>long-legged ant</i> [itself: but this is perhaps a mistranscription]. (TA.)

